Claude Prompt – Build Delivery Copilot AI (MVP)

Build a production-quality MVP named Delivery Copilot AI, an AI-powered Requirements Engineering and JIRA Story Intelligence platform for enterprise banking technology teams.

The application should help Business Analysts, Product Owners, Architects, Tech Leads, and Developers generate, review, refine, and manage JIRA Epics and User Stories using Amazon Bedrock (Anthropic Claude), while leveraging existing JIRA projects and source code repositories as contextual knowledge.

Technology Stack

Frontend

* React 19
* TypeScript
* Vite
* Material UI
* React Query
* React Router
* Monaco Editor
* React Flow (tree visualization)
* Zustand for state management

Backend

* Python FastAPI
* SQLAlchemy
* SQLite for MVP (designed to migrate easily to PostgreSQL)
* Alembic migrations

AI

* Amazon Bedrock
* Anthropic Claude Sonnet
* Prompt templates stored in database
* Streaming responses

Integrations

* Atlassian JIRA REST API
* GitHub/GitLab repository integration
* Local repository indexing
* Markdown document generation

Authentication

* Simple local authentication for MVP
* Role-based authorization
* Workspace ownership

